# ============================================================
# Ruler - governance repository
#
# Whitelist-only tracking: EVERYTHING is ignored by default and
# only the governance system is explicitly allowed in. Even a
# careless `git add -A` cannot leak .env files, product code,
# contact CSVs, or secrets into this repository.
#
# Pattern rules (gitignore semantics):
#   /*            ignore every root entry
#   !/<entry>     re-include a specific root entry
#   /dir/*        ignore children of a re-included dir...
#   !/dir/sub/    ...then re-include only the wanted subtree
# ============================================================

/*

# --- repo meta ---
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md

# --- requirements library (docs/requirements ONLY - nothing
#     else inside docs/ may ever be committed) ---
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/requirements/
!/docs/requirements/**

# --- automation (PowerShell scripts ONLY - no temp files,
#     no logs, no binaries from scripts/) ---
!/scripts/
/scripts/*
!/scripts/*.ps1

# --- junk, anywhere ---
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
